<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ValoSkin Shop - Home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">VALOSKIN SHOP</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="/" class="active">Home</a>
            <a href="/skins">Catalog</a>
            <a href="/search">Search</a>
            <a href="/api/skins">API Skins</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="welcome-box">
            <h1>WEB700 Project Part 2 - Express Backend</h1>
            <p>Welcome to ValoSkin Shop Backend API and Storefront! Browse, search, and inspect Valorant weapon skins.</p>
            <p>Developed by <strong>Yasmin & Sophia</strong> for WEB700 Web Programming.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="routes-section">
            <h2>Available Project Routes</h2>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge html">HTML</span> <a href="/"><code>GET /</code></a> - Home landing page</div>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge html">HTML</span> <a href="/skins"><code>GET /skins</code></a> - EJS catalog view displaying skins</div>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge html">HTML</span> <a href="/search"><code>GET /search</code> & <code>POST /search</code></a> - Search form & results</div>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge json">JSON</span> <a href="/api/skins"><code>GET /api/skins</code></a> - Returns all skins as JSON</div>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge json">JSON</span> <code>GET /api/skins/:id</code> - Returns single skin by ID</div>
            <div class="route-card"><span class="badge json">JSON</span> <a href="/api/search?keyword=vandal"><code>GET /api/search?keyword=vandal</code></a> - Search skins via API</div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 ValoSkin Shop - Seneca WEB700 Project Part 2</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>